      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift and i feel like im just drowning. saw another kid tonight... nothing we did really mattered in the end. it just feels like we're trying to empty the ocean with a spoon. i'm so tired of fighting for lives that just seem to break anyway.",
